{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想讓孩子在升小前打好閱讀基礎，這款針對學前至小二的識字拼讀 App 正好合用。《Sight Words &amp; Phonics Cards》以常見字卡、自然拼讀與字母練習為核心，配合語音辨識與家長獎勵機制，讓孩子每天用五分鐘輕鬆累積認字能力。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>五分鐘親子閱讀訓練</h2>\n<p>App 提供清晰的單字發音與即時鼓勵回饋，孩子可自行練習常見字與拼讀技巧，毋須家長全程陪伴。家長可選擇年級、設定練習長度、管理多個孩子檔案，並以 PIN 保護設定。所有資料只留在裝置，支援離線使用，亦無訂閱或經常性收費，讓識字練習簡單而專注。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-174-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-175-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-176-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-177-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-178-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sight Words &amp; Phonics Cards</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T01:04:50.819547+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}